        text: () => beat3(ctx.char, "babanuki") ? `"The Prisoner Mine is open! The old bosses of Wano stand with the Kozuki again. Now \u2014 Ryuo. Again. Feel it flow."` : `"Heh... they starve us to keep us weak. You want to learn Ryuo, kid? Haki isn't a coat of armour. Let it flow into your enemy \u2014 and break them from the inside."`,
